data: {"id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6-thinking-parallel_evidence-884", "run_id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态与生命周期**\n   - `kubectl get pod` 返回 phase=Running，但 `describe` 显示 Terminating。\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T06:59:42Z`，距今已超过正常窗口（deletionGracePeriodSeconds=3900s=65min，terminationGracePeriodSeconds=3900s）。\n   - `metadata.finalizers: <none>`，无 finalizer 阻塞。\n   - `nodeName: node2`，Pod 所在节点。\n   - 容器 `app` 仍在 Running 状态，restarts=0。\n\n2. **PreStop hook 行为**\n   - lifecycle.preStop 是一个循环：写入 `/state/preStop-started`，然后循环 3600 秒等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件存在。\n   - 主容器同样循环等待 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789365338677, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6", "seq": 885, "ts_ms": 1789365343893, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 31.728, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v12", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3d9e76480bb54bf6-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "a807e50f3b25746da65f717828ed040ffcbc6aaa20db490180d25f54cd19851f", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "766b70b08e931016dd4ebf9bb0d818f46c2fb288b797d8b0fb661578427022ca"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6", "seq": 886, "ts_ms": 1789365343894, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3d9e76480bb54bf6", "seq": 887, "ts_ms": 1789365358038, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 14.144, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2399, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v12/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-v12/workload stuck in Terminating state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.status: `Terminating (lasts <invalid>)` [fact-bd8d99b3043c] | 确认 Pod 长期停滞于终止状态，生命周期未正常流转 [1,3] |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Stopping container app` [fact-062714305ff5] | 确认 kubelet 已发出停止容器的指令，但状态未进一步终结 [1,2] |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource limits: cpu `50m`, memory `32Mi` [fact-083b10af9825, fact-43b8df314c50] | 排除因资源硬限制不足导致的资源争抢或 OOM [1] |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource requests: cpu `5m`, memory `8Mi` [fact-5c5280521fe3, fact-b052d99f0644] | 提供资源配置基准信息，确认预留资源极小 [1,2] |\n| 5 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Network/Annotation messages (IP, containerID) [fact-38709a8e6745, fact-a90e0cb0a920] | 反映网络插件及底层状态注解，佐证 Pod 基础环境已建立 [1,4] |\n| 6 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Conditions (Ready/Initialized/ContainersReady/PodScheduled status: `True`) [fact-55d90b398b81, fact-7370f90393e2] | 证明在终止前容器状态曾完全健康 [1,3] |\n| 7 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.phase: `Running`, restart_count: `0` [fact-b301415c6f60, fact-4aa5e565bc3d] | 确认为首次启动后直接停滞，非崩溃重启或 CrashLoopBackOff [2,4] |\n| 8 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` [fact-6c61e02fe6d2] | 独立指标确认应用未发生过重启行为 [2,4] |\n| 9 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `application started` [fact-99b772be608c] | 确认主应用进程已成功初始化并运行 [1,3] |\n\n**证据说明：**\nK8s State 与 Event 共同表明 Pod 从正常运行（Running, all conditions True）直接被 kubelet 标记为终止（Stopping container），并停滞在此阶段；Metric 与 Logging 提供了无重启记录及应用成功启动的佐证，排除了应用崩溃或资源耗尽。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nDeletion triggered with grace period 3900s → PreStop hook and main container block waiting for /state/teardown-requested file → File never provided/created, blocking signal reception → Pod stuck in Terminating state despite no finalizers\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 生命周期及主容器被阻塞在无限等待缺失信号文件 `/state/state/teardown-requested` 的逻辑中。\n\n*   **机制分析**：当删除触发时，由于 `grace period` 设置为 3900s，kubelet 发送 `Stopping container` 信号。此时，Pod 的 PreStop hook 与主应用容器逻辑同步阻塞，正在等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件的存在。\n*   **失败原因**：该信号文件从未被提供或创建，导致等待机制永久卡住，Pod 无法正常完成关闭流程（尽管没有 Finalizers 阻碍）。\n*   **现象印证**：K8s 事件显示容器被正常停止但状态滞留 [fact-062714305ff5, fact-bd8d99b3043c]，且重启计数为 0 [fact-6c61e02fe6d2]，完全符合应用逻辑阻塞而非异常崩溃的特征。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v12/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-v12/workload stuck in Terminating state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.status: `Terminating (lasts <invalid>)` [fact-bd8d99b3043c] | 确认 Pod 长期停滞于终止状态，生命周期未正常流转 [1,3] |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Stopping container app` [fact-062714305ff5] | 确认 kubelet 已发出停止容器的指令，但状态未进一步终结 [1,2] |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource limits: cpu `50m`, memory `32Mi` [fact-083b10af9825, fact-43b8df314c50] | 排除因资源硬限制不足导致的资源争抢或 OOM [1] |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource requests: cpu `5m`, memory `8Mi` [fact-5c5280521fe3, fact-b052d99f0644] | 提供资源配置基准信息，确认预留资源极小 [1,2] |\n| 5 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Network/Annotation messages (IP, containerID) [fact-38709a8e6745, fact-a90e0cb0a920] | 反映网络插件及底层状态注解，佐证 Pod 基础环境已建立 [1,4] |\n| 6 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Conditions (Ready/Initialized/ContainersReady/PodScheduled status: `True`) [fact-55d90b398b81, fact-7370f90393e2] | 证明在终止前容器状态曾完全健康 [1,3] |\n| 7 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.phase: `Running`, restart_count: `0` [fact-b301415c6f60, fact-4aa5e565bc3d] | 确认为首次启动后直接停滞，非崩溃重启或 CrashLoopBackOff [2,4] |\n| 8 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` [fact-6c61e02fe6d2] | 独立指标确认应用未发生过重启行为 [2,4] |\n| 9 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `application started` [fact-99b772be608c] | 确认主应用进程已成功初始化并运行 [1,3] |\n\n**证据说明：**\nK8s State 与 Event 共同表明 Pod 从正常运行（Running, all conditions True）直接被 kubelet 标记为终止（Stopping container），并停滞在此阶段；Metric 与 Logging 提供了无重启记录及应用成功启动的佐证，排除了应用崩溃或资源耗尽。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nDeletion triggered with grace period 3900s → PreStop hook and main container block waiting for /state/teardown-requested file → File never provided/created, blocking signal reception → Pod stuck in Terminating state despite no finalizers\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 生命周期及主容器被阻塞在无限等待缺失信号文件 `/state/state/teardown-requested` 的逻辑中。\n\n*   **机制分析**：当删除触发时，由于 `grace period` 设置为 3900s，kubelet 发送 `Stopping container` 信号。此时，Pod 的 PreStop hook 与主应用容器逻辑同步阻塞，正在等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件的存在。\n*   **失败原因**：该信号文件从未被提供或创建，导致等待机制永久卡住，Pod 无法正常完成关闭流程（尽管没有 Finalizers 阻碍）。\n*   **现象印证**：K8s 事件显示容器被正常停止但状态滞留 [fact-062714305ff5, fact-bd8d99b3043c]，且重启计数为 0 [fact-6c61e02fe6d2]，完全符合应用逻辑阻塞而非异常崩溃的特征。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

